<metadata><name>Galičica trail G-7</name><desc>G-7 is one of Galičica National Park's high ridge trails above 1,600 m. It's 1.5 km from Dva Javora to Tomoros peak, with about 186 m of climbing and 11 m of descent in the direction drawn, between 1,481 m and 1,666 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/g-7/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
